# The API + MCP live on the Render server, not on Pages (static hosting only).
# Proxy /api/* there so orbitx.world/api/mcp and /api/mcp-launchpad answer as
# real MCP servers (POST initialize) instead of 405 / SPA fallback.
# Share links are served by the Render API too (it renders the OG unfurl card).
/api/* https://orbitx-platform-api.onrender.com/api/:splat 200
/share/* https://orbitx-platform-api.onrender.com/share/:splat 200
/sharew/* https://orbitx-platform-api.onrender.com/sharew/:splat 200
